@startuml UC-58
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-58.md
title UC-58: Create / Update Voucher
footer Feature AVOU-01 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-25
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/VouchersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "VoucherService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Submit voucher form (code, name, type, value, max discount,\nmin order, usage limit, start, end)
alt new voucher
  MVC -> API : POST /api/admin/vouchers
else existing voucher
  MVC -> API : PUT /api/admin/vouchers/{id}
end
API -> SVC : SaveAsync(request)
SVC -> SVC : Validate (BR-25): type Percent/Fixed, value > 0,\npercent <= 100, StartAt < EndAt, amounts >= 0
SVC -> DB : Any other voucher with the same Code?
alt invalid values
  SVC --> API : ValidationException
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show errors
else duplicate code
  SVC --> API : Conflict
  API --> MVC : 409 Conflict
  MVC --> U : Show "Code already exists"
else UsageLimit < current UsedCount
  SVC --> API : BadRequest
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show "Usage limit is below times already used"
else valid
  SVC -> DB : Insert or update voucher\nSaveChangesAsync
  SVC --> API : VoucherDto
  API --> MVC : 200 OK / 201 Created
  MVC --> U : Show voucher list
end

@enduml
